{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641020","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1064102001:2":{"text":"눈부신 아침 햇살이 집 안으로 쏟아져 들어왔다. 그 빛은 난장판이 된 실내와, 피웅덩이 속에 쓰러진 레로의 참혹한 모습을 적나라하게 비추었다.","source_cn":"刺目的晨光映入屋内，照出了满地狼藉，以及躺在血泊中的列罗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5EFF9D67C9382E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1064102002:1":{"text":"그 옆, 어두운 그늘 속에 아미니가 무릎을 꿇고 있었다. 그녀는 사시나무처럼 떨며, 마치 레로에게 먹이려는 듯 포션이 든 병 하나를 꼭 쥐고 있었다.","source_cn":"埃米妮跪在他身旁的阴影里，止不住地战栗着，拿着一瓶药似...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x969A45D2EE806AD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064102003:1":{"text":"하지만 안타깝게도, 레로의 가슴은 이미 미동조차 하지 않았다...","source_cn":"可惜，那没有任何作用。列罗的胸口早已没了起伏的迹象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646C8EB29D0B85E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064102004:1":{"text":"레로, 레로... 조금만 버텨줘. 내가 구해줄게...","source_cn":"列罗……列罗，坚持住。我……我一定能救你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC1D94F7AEE430E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064102005:1":{"text":"아빠, 아빠... 일어나요! 수녀님들을 모셔 왔어요. 신께서 지켜주실 거예요!","source_cn":"爸爸……爸爸醒一醒！我把修女们找来了，神……神一定会庇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECA573E4DB4AE492","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064102006:1":{"text":"아빠, 일어나요... 흑흑...","source_cn":"爸爸……你醒醒啊……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0E3B43888A61FF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064102007:1":{"text":"아무래도 한발 늦은 것 같군요.","source_cn":"看来我们来晚了一步……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62CC708C3D522810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064102008:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064102009:1":{"text":"죄송해요, 아미니. 저희가 늦었네요...","source_cn":"抱歉，埃米妮，我们没能及时赶到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2DD522B4DF2BD4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064102010:1":{"text":"레로는 이미 세상을 떠났어요. 그가 남은 가족 걱정에 구천을 떠돌지 않고 여신님의 품으로 돌아갈 수 있게, 이제 그만 손을 놓아주세요.","source_cn":"列罗……他已经离去。请放开他的手，让他回到艾雅身边，不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x786F9F298E4D662D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064102011:1":{"text":"마, 말도 안 돼요... 레로가 이렇게 죽을 리 없어요!","source_cn":"不，不，怎么可能……列罗他不会死的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5246E0EF28F1954C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064102012:1":{"text":"이 포션... 이 포션이라면 분명 살릴 수 있을 텐데, 왜 효과가 없는 거죠?!","source_cn":"这瓶药……这瓶药明明能救他，为什么不起作用？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD57464529BDC5200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064102013:1":{"text":"믿을 수 없어요... 레로가 죽다니... 분명 평생을 함께하기로 약속했는데... 왜...","source_cn":"我不相信……他怎么可能会死？我们明明约定过要共度一生…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE42D402C04D99954","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064102014:1":{"text":"그래요, 그래요... 그 고통은 이해합니다.","source_cn":"是的，是的……我明白你的痛苦，埃米妮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87B956184C7B28E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064102015:1":{"text":"울어도 돼요. 울면 모든 게 나아질 거예요...","source_cn":"哭出来吧。哭出来，一切都会慢慢好起来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEB2821A412BD04C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064102016:1":{"text":"아미니, 당신도 치료를 받아야 해요.","source_cn":"你也需要治疗，埃米妮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B8C3D27ED4DBAF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064102017:1":{"text":"...그리고 무슨 일이 있어도 마음 다잡으셔야 해요. 아직 길라코가 있잖아요.","source_cn":"……也请振作一点吧。无论如何，你还有吉拉科。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87BFD9967EEC3B9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064102018:1":{"text":"엉엉... 엄마...","source_cn":"呜呜呜，妈妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB15EB8698EC258C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064102019:1":{"text":"길라코... 가여운 우리 아가...","source_cn":"吉拉科……我可怜的孩子……呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F1BA4A0247EA01B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064102020:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여, 이 가엾은 모자를 지켜주소서...","source_cn":"艾雅在上，多么可怜的一对母子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03FF93BB8AB931E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064102021:1":{"text":"루이자 수녀님, 레로의 장례는 어떻게 해야 하나요? 그리고 범인은... 어떻게 찾아야 하죠?","source_cn":"路易莎修女，列罗的后事该怎么办？还有杀害他的真凶，该怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AC5E47EE66F4099","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064102022:1":{"text":"우선 아미니와 함께 레로의 시신을 성당으로 옮기세요. 수도사들이 장례를 준비할 겁니다. 저는 여기 남아 범인이 남긴 흔적을 찾지요.","source_cn":"你先陪埃米妮和吉拉科将列罗的遗体运到教堂吧，修士们会为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA410D52F5E5C4508","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064102023:1":{"text":"당장 범인을 특정할 수 없다면, 최대한 빨리 이 사실을 알려 마을 사람들이 경계하도록 해야 합니다.","source_cn":"如果暂时无法确定凶手的身份，这件事也必须尽早通知各位村...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB51FF7AAEA887CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064102024:1":{"text":"알겠어.","source_cn":"好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2839CC05014FE4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:31::0":{"text":"블랙골드 포션","source_cn":"黑金药水","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21DB926DD5667D11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064102025:0":{"text":"아미니가 레로에게 먹이려 했던 이 병도 함께 성당으로 가져가야 할까요? 병에 새겨진 표식이 조금 이상한 것 같아서요.","source_cn":"埃米妮喂给列罗的这瓶药要不要一起带回教堂？瓶身上的印记...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x715B3530DB1F306F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064102026:0":{"text":"현장을 훼손하면 안 되니 일단 여기에 두지요.","source_cn":"暂时留在这里吧，不要破坏周围的痕迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9384341337479C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064102027:1":{"text":"아마 레로의 죽음을 받아들이지 못한 아미니가 필사적으로 남편을 깨우려고 썼을 겁니다...","source_cn":"我想，埃米妮只是一时无法接受列罗的离去，才会绞尽脑汁地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB15480751F7A533E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:37:1064102028:0":{"text":"아이다는 두 모자와 함께 레로의 시신을 성당으로 옮겼다","source_cn":"艾达陪伴着母子俩，将列罗的遗体运回了教堂","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2F9B16DFF70A76C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:38:1064102029:0":{"text":"얼마 뒤, 루이자도 돌아왔다","source_cn":"不久之后，路易莎也匆匆返回","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA54477FDABA1CD12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064102030:1":{"text":"루이자 수녀님, 범인이 남긴 단서는 찾으셨나요?","source_cn":"路易莎修女，您有找到凶手留下的线索吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC65002CE398882F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064102031:1":{"text":"동이 트기 전에 일어난 사건이라, 이웃 사람들조차 범인이 어느 쪽으로 도주했는지 보지 못했다고 합니다.","source_cn":"事发时天还未亮，列罗家周围的村民都没有看到凶手逃往了何处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4442FC4E91352B8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064102032:1":{"text":"마을에 사람을 보내 상황을 전파하고, 수비병들에게 정식으로 조사를 요청해 두었습니다.","source_cn":"我已经派人去镇上通报此事，请求守卫前来调查了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8C61547675120E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064102033:1":{"text":"네, 알겠습니다.","source_cn":"是，这样应该更妥帖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC96A44873D5CF9B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064102034:1":{"text":"루이자 수녀님, 아미니를 좀 설득해 주세요. 저와 콘타그 수도사님이 무슨 말을 해도 울기만 해서...","source_cn":"路易莎修女，请您劝劝埃米妮吧。无论我和康塔格修士说什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADF9ADA9D0036822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064102035:1":{"text":"이런... 알겠어요.","source_cn":"唉……我明白了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x849CB931A1ED98E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064102036:1":{"text":"아미니, 많이 힘드시죠? 이런 때에 아침의 일을 떠올리게 하는 건 잔인한 부탁일지도 모르지만... 범인을 잡으려면 반드시 짚고 넘어가야 할 문제입니다.","source_cn":"埃米妮，我知道你此刻还沉浸在悲伤之中，让你回忆今早的事...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE93FEB53473298C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064102037:1":{"text":"혹시 레로를 공격한 사람의 모습을 보았나요?","source_cn":"你有没有看清，袭击列罗的人长什么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAC4887943776C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064102038:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064102039:1":{"text":"조금만 힘을 내세요. 범인을 잡아야 레로의 원수를 갚을 수 있어요.","source_cn":"请振作一点。只有抓到凶手，我们才能替列罗报仇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB582896D175286F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064102040:1":{"text":"맞아요. 범인에게 벌을 내려야지요. 저희와 레로를 도와줄 수 있는 건 아미니, 당신뿐이에요.","source_cn":"是的，造成这一切的歹徒应当受到惩罚。现在只有你能帮助我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F25DCB0993BFFD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064102041:1":{"text":"네, 네...","source_cn":"我、我知道了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4532390DF144CD27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064102042:1":{"text":"레로를 공격한 사람은 키가 크고... 머리카락도 길었어요...","source_cn":"袭击列罗的那个人，个子很高，头发也有些长……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD97C845B3CB7D0A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064102043:1":{"text":"누, 눈동자도 파란색이었던 것 같아요. 너무 어두워서 자세히 못 봤지만요...","source_cn":"好像……好像是是蓝眼睛。那时候天色太暗，我只是模模糊糊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44D51760DC33F8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064102044:1":{"text":"범인이 무슨 말을 했나요? 이후 행적을 추측할 수 있을지도 모르겠군요.","source_cn":"凶手可有说过什么？我们或许能推测出他之后的去向。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A8A919C1330ED5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064102045:1":{"text":"그, 그 사람이...","source_cn":"他、他说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E32495DBC9AF33A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064102046:1":{"text":"...아뇨, 아무 말도 하지 않았어요... 어, 어쨌든 전부 제 잘못이에요. 제 잘못이라고요!","source_cn":"……不，他什么也没说……总之，总之都是我的错！是我的错！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAACBA716E5DEF505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064102047:1":{"text":"제가 엔사 마을에 오지만 않았다면, 제가 행복을 바라지 않았다면, 제가 여기 머물지 않았다면... 레로는 죽지 않았을 거예요...! 흑흑흑!","source_cn":"要不是我来了恩莎村，要不是我奢望幸福，要不是我赖在这儿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9131F070580FC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064102048:1":{"text":"아미니, 자책하지 말아요. 레로의 죽음은 당신 탓이 아니에요. 그저 불행한 사고였을 뿐이에요.","source_cn":"埃米妮，请不要自责，列罗的离去只是一个意外，和你没有关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD58EC31C360B0DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064102049:1":{"text":"아뇨, 수녀님은 모르세요... 이건 전부 제 잘못이에요!","source_cn":"不，你不明白……这就是我的错！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53E46F8326116E20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064102050:1":{"text":"엄마, 엄마... 흐어엉...","source_cn":"妈妈，妈妈……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF62270AB39B32566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064102051:1":{"text":"에휴...","source_cn":"唉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC104553A784DD22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064102052:1":{"text":"아이다 수녀님, 길라코와 함께 바람이라도 쐬고 오실래요? 여기는 저와 콘타그 수도사님이 맡지요.","source_cn":"艾达修女，你先带吉拉科出去透透气。这里交给我和康塔格修士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62D7A8BCA8B4B60E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1064102053:1":{"text":"아이가 들어서는 안 될 내용인 것 같네요.","source_cn":"有些话，不适合让孩子们听到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C1052DFA3BCA5B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064102054:1":{"text":"네, 루이자 수녀님.","source_cn":"是，路易莎修女。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D793980CD5ABF5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:74:1064102055:0":{"text":"아이다가 길라코를 데리고 성당 밖 조용한 곳으로 나왔다","source_cn":"艾达牵着吉拉科来到教堂外的安静之处","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19A190831F4D3F77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064102056:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064102057:1":{"text":"아이다 누나, 엄마가... 왜 저런 말을 하는 거예요?","source_cn":"艾达姐姐，为什么……为什么我妈妈会说那样的话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x613E2EEA27CF7231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064102058:1":{"text":"그리고 아빠는... 정말 못 돌아와요?","source_cn":"还有爸爸……他真的再也不会回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F847C9A8B4AEDB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064102059:1":{"text":"...아버지는 여신님의 나라로 돌아가 안식을 얻으실 거예요.","source_cn":"……他已经回归了女神的天国，他会在那里获得安息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7416EAC539097F81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064102060:1":{"text":"어머니는... 오늘 받은 충격이 너무 커서, 잠시 현실을 받아들이지 못하고 있을 뿐이죠.","source_cn":"至于你母亲，她只是受到的打击太大，一时无法接受现实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99621CF4515528A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064102061:1":{"text":"길라코가 마음을 단단히 먹고, 지켜드리면 분명 괜찮아지실 거예요. 알겠죠?","source_cn":"如果你能坚强地陪伴她度过这段时间，她一定很快就能好起来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9421208ABC78EBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064102062:1":{"text":"아, 알았어요... 아빠도 항상 엄마를 지켜줘야 한다고 했으니까요...","source_cn":"我……我知道。爸爸以前经常和我说，要保护妈妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B017DB464EDCA23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064102063:1":{"text":"하지만 나쁜 사람은 아직 안 잡혔잖아요. 또 엄마를 해치려고 하면... 어떻게 해야 해요?","source_cn":"可是，坏人还没有抓到……要是他还想伤害我妈妈，我该怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37028ADFB4015103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064102064:1":{"text":"나쁜 사람은... 왜 벌을 안 받는 거예요?","source_cn":"坏人……为什么没有受到惩罚呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27ED26287DCB33A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064102065:1":{"text":"... ","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1064102066:1":{"text":"길라코, 이야기 하나 들려줄까요?","source_cn":"吉拉科，我给你讲个故事吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B9D35069EA7F31B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1064102067:1":{"text":"...무슨 이야기요?","source_cn":"……什么故事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A0CF7A6F1727FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1064102068:1":{"text":"듀라 여신님을 섬기는 “징벌의 검”, 아탈리아 님 이야기를 들어본 적 있나요?","source_cn":"你听说过侍奉艾雅的“天罚之刃”——阿塔利娅吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x931833E040F3E38E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:90:1064102069:1":{"text":"“징벌의 검”이요?","source_cn":"天罚之刃？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3EED1E4F3029AB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:91:1064102070:1":{"text":"성전의 기록에 따르면, 아탈리아 님은 듀라 여신님의 창이자, 여신님의 은혜를 받아 인간의 모습을 갖게 된 최초의 반신이세요.","source_cn":"在圣典的记载中，阿塔利娅是艾雅女神的骑枪，也是第一位蒙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x930FCC3CF633A723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1064102071:1":{"text":"악을 증오하는 정의의 심판자로서, 악을 소탕하는 사명을 짊어지고 있다고 하죠.","source_cn":"在传说中，她是嫉恶如仇的正义裁决者，肩负着肃清邪恶的使命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69DE6DC24883E5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:93:1064102072:1":{"text":"나쁜 사람에게 괴롭힘을 당할 때, 아탈리아 님께 진심으로 기도하면 하늘에서 내려와 나쁜 사람을 법의 심판대에 세운다고 해요. 그 누구도 도망칠 수 없답니다.","source_cn":"如果有人被恶人伤害，只要虔诚地向阿塔利娅大人祈祷，她就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC713A741FB94250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:94:1064102073:1":{"text":"...정말요? 정말 기도하기만 하면 나쁜 사람이 벌을 받나요?","source_cn":"……真的吗？只要虔诚地祈祷，坏人就能得到惩罚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DFB542C036F3C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:95:1064102074:1":{"text":"그럼요! 아탈리아 님은 정의의 심판자시니까요.","source_cn":"当然，阿塔利娅大人可是正义的裁决者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8EA786770AB26DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:96:1064102075:1":{"text":"네, 알겠어요!","source_cn":"嗯，我明白了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F5F7C8A64388FDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:97:1064102076:1":{"text":"위대하신 아탈리아 님, 나쁜 사람에게 벌을 주고, 아빠 대신 복수를 해주세요!","source_cn":"厉害的阿塔利娅大人，求您一定惩罚坏人，替我爸爸报仇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BD1939610C49715","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:98:1064102077:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:99:1064102078:1":{"text":"아이다 누나, 이렇게 기도하면 아탈리아 님이 제 목소리를 들어주실까요?","source_cn":"艾达姐姐，这样做是不是阿塔利娅大人就能听见了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE560784DCB78B66A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:100:1064102079:1":{"text":"그럼요.","source_cn":"嗯，一定会的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ACDC8AFE865C98D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:101:1064102080:1":{"text":"그럼 엄마한테도 알려줘서 같이 기도할래요, 그러면 아탈리아 님이 분명 아빠의 원수를 갚아 주실 거예요!","source_cn":"那我也要告诉妈妈，让她也和我一起祈祷，这样阿塔利娅大人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD44E0E0FFF22A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:102:1064102081:1":{"text":"지금 바로 가볼게요!","source_cn":"我现在就去找她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C73A3A4AB86214C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:103:1064102082:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:104:1064102083:1":{"text":"전쟁이 끝난 지도 벌써 10년이 흘렀군요... 그동안 반신들께서 모습을 드러내신 건 손에 꼽을 정도였죠...","source_cn":"战争结束已经十年了……这十年间，半神们现身的次数却寥寥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9964CB54ABA6F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:105:1064102084:1":{"text":"아탈리아 님, 저희 인간의 기도가 들리신다면 이 가련한 모자를 가엾게 여기시어, 가정을 파괴한 악당을 벌해주소서...","source_cn":"阿塔利娅大人，若您能听到凡人的祈祷，祈求您怜悯这对可怜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7B929DB645D90EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃米妮":{"text":"아미니","source":"埃米妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:吉拉科":{"text":"길라코","source":"吉拉科","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修女路易莎":{"text":"수녀 루이자","source":"修女路易莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修女艾达":{"text":"수녀 아이다","source":"修女艾达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏文字":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏文字","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士康塔格":{"text":"수도사 콘타그","source":"修士康塔格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":86,"localized_text_count":85,"speaker_count":7}}